flowchart TB
  accTitle: From a request to a checked result
  accDescr: Devi submits a request in ISC. Her manager approves or rejects it. Rejection stops this request without a grant. Approval allows ISC to initiate a change through the connector. The application either adds the permission or rejects the operation in the illustrated cases. The engineer checks the activity and current account state for either result.
  request["Devi&#58; request INVOICE_VIEW in ISC"]
  review["Manager&#58; review the request in ISC"]
  declined["Request ends without a grant from this request"]
  provision["ISC&#58; initiate the account change"]
  connector["Connector&#58; send the change to the application"]
  application["Finance application&#58; process the operation"]
  changed["INVOICE_VIEW added to Devi's existing account"]
  unchanged["Operation rejected&#59; account unchanged in this case"]
  verify["Engineer&#58; check activity and current target state"]
  request -->|Configured manager review| review
  review -->|Manager rejects| declined
  review -->|Manager approves| provision
  provision -->|Supported change operation| connector
  connector -->|Application receives operation| application
  application -->|Successful change| changed
  application -->|Illustrated permission failure| unchanged
  changed -.->|Verify result| verify
  unchanged -.->|Investigate result| verify
